      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Hmm, not really: on a CPU that is not the first CPU, the CPU may be already deprivileged and already gone out of the IPI interrupt context, but pkvm_enabled_key not set by the first CPU yet, so the CPU may still try to access MMIO directly?\n\nAhh yes, you are right - there is still a small window of race that could happen. I haven\u0027t seen any EPT violations yet on my testing though. A less complicated addon we could do is to wait on a completion variable until the first cpu sets the static key. What do you think?",
